  "comparative_observations": [
    "Enabledfalse drops a point; optional PHMT coverage retains it. Requirement enum and paper extension do not qualify complete optional/negated matching.",
    "JSON reader checks requirement membership but required string type; unexecuted r95 field-name inconsistency, no external issue publication.",
    "Typed triplet planning, reduced geometric ranges, context fingerprints, conformer joins and final fit/acceptance are separate stages.",
    "Radius-weighted fitting, unweighted returned RMSD and PHMT coverage/seeded scores have different meanings.",
    "Packed precision/capacity, coarse direction masks, exclusion boundary and stopping denominators need explicit controls.",
    "Source inspection does not establish no-false-negative geometric encoding or PHMT acceleration."
  ],
